mechaber.en:
He said, “But he’s in his clothes, and he’s in his hands, and he’s given to him, and he’s like, and he’s done so.”
It is said that you are like a stranger, and that you will be able to do so, but if you say that you are not afraid of it, you will be able to do so
&quot;And if he is ashamed of Hashem's mercy, he will not be able to do so, but he will be cursed, and he will not be given to him.&quot;
